Each WO carries a code-verified survey of what exists today + acceptance criteria.

  326  Custom scaling of layers in looks — geometry (X/Y/W/H via fill) already exists
       end-to-end; WO starts with a 10-min live check of what you actually mean
       (bug in the existing path vs content-zoom-in-rect vs a scale% control).
  327  Compose-preview dest borders vs custom res — root cause found: the overlay's
       fallback auto-tiler hardcodes 1920x1080 cells and never reads the destination's
       stored width/height (preview-canvas-destination-overlay.js:53-67).
  328  Media continues playback between looks — continuity machinery already exists
       (visual-equal skip, SWAP TRANSFORMS, seek-resume); WO lists the 5 ranked
       suspects for why your case restarts, needs a live repro to pick one.
  329  Loading/saving projects + two clients — kill the wall-clock savedAt 409 with a
       server monotonic rev; two clients today = silent last-write-wins (whole-project
       overwrite on every project_sync); recommend an advisory edit-lock first.
  330  Companion module — NOT greenfield: highpass-highascg 1.0.3 already exists in
       /home/casparcg/companion-module-dev with its own WO + QA checklist, installer in
       tools/eggs/companion. WO = audit checklist vs source, install-verify on box,
       desk QA with your streamdeck, close gaps, repackage.
  331  Live-input thumbnail refresh — root cause found: sources-panel-live-render.js:131
       busts the URL with Date.now() on EVERY render (deck thumbs correctly use the
       30s TTL window), so every state tick refetches. Small client fix.
  332  Power button — listener already does short=network-reset / hold>=3s=poweroff;
       missing: UI Shutdown button + endpoint, configurable actions/threshold,
       service health in Devices view. Scope check with you first.

